<title>POLAND: BFK MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 4.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>BFK MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 4.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.46 vs   1.96</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.35 vs   2.46</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.99 vs   3.18</p>
<p> Sales		   29.90 vs  28.11</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     9.97 vs   4.08</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	17.10 vs   7.21</p>
<p> Operating profit    18.47 vs   9.22</p>
<p> Sales		   85.61 vs  72.83</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cable maker is Bydgoska Fabryka</p>
<p>Kabli SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
